controls_configured.description:
Without these, the group commands each shade separately, so shades that start level still start a fraction of a second apart. A Pico or Lutron scene starts all its shades with one command, at exactly the same moment, and the group uses one whenever it can.

A Pico can also stop its shades together; a scene can only start them.

